But the existing base `.mobile-actions` bottom 26, joystick bottom 150. Add overrides in max-width 760. Also maybe `.mobile-actions` should be a 3x3 grid; 8 buttons + block/run = 10 buttons, 4 rows. Height 4*50+3*6=218px. At bottom 104, top=522. Fine. Joystick at bottom 160, top=568. They overlap horizontally? Joystick left, actions right. Good.

But player card at bottom 10 with height ~70. Actions bottom 104, so clear.

